// # oomesh package
//
// Logline: Canonical catalog package anchor for oomesh (layers/L6-cloud).
//
// Setup: Folder shape is manifest plus payload (oomesh.oo).
//
// Beats:
//   1. manifest — name, version, caps, sha256 of oomesh.oo.
